<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="hero hero-photo" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <span class="spark s1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="spark s2" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="spark s3" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="spark s4" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="spark s5" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="spark s6" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <img class="hero-logo" src="/static/img/logo-md.png" alt="NISMCAA logo" width="150" height="150">
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="shimmer">NISMCAA Meeting Room</h1>
    <p class="lead">A private members area for NISMCAA volunteers in the United States, Nigeria, Canada, the United Arab Emirates, the United Kingdom and Australia.</p>
    <p>Volunteer, take the course, pass the final test, get approved by an administrator, and join your country team.</p>
    <p class="cta">
      <% if (user) { %><a class="btn gold" href="/meeting-room">Open the Meeting Room</a>
      <% } else { %><a class="btn gold" href="/meeting-room">Meeting Room (members sign in)</a> <a class="btn gold" href="/sign-up">Sign up to volunteer</a> <a class="btn ghost on-dark" href="/sign-in">Sign in</a><% } %>
    </p>
    <ul class="hero-chips" aria-label="At a glance"><li>6 countries</li><li>7 child-protection lessons</li><li>Free to volunteer</li></ul>
  </div>
</section>
<h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>What volunteers do</h2>
<div class="meet-photos" data-reveal>
  <figure><img src="/static/img/volunteers-seating.jpg" alt="NISMCAA volunteers guiding students to their seats at an event" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Welcoming students at our events</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><img src="/static/img/volunteers-teaching.jpg" alt="A NISMCAA volunteer teaching music to a class" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Teaching music in the classroom</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Your volunteer journey</h2>
<div class="grid steps">
  <div class="card step"><span class="step-ico"><%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'learn', size: 28 }) %></span><h3>1. Learn</h3><p>Read the volunteer course. It is open to everyone, no sign-in needed. <a href="/course">Open the course</a>.</p></div>
  <div class="card step"><span class="step-ico"><%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'test', size: 28 }) %></span><h3>2. Take the final test</h3><p>50 questions. To pass you need 80% overall and at least 9 of 10 on the child-protection questions.</p></div>
  <div class="card step"><span class="step-ico"><%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'approval', size: 28 }) %></span><h3>3. Get approved</h3><p>An administrator reviews your application, confirms your country and department, and issues your volunteer ID card.</p></div>
  <div class="card step"><span class="step-ico"><%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'join', size: 28 }) %></span><h3>4. Join the team</h3><p>Approved volunteers use the call link, chat, notes and the action plan for their country.</p></div>
</div>
<p class="note"><%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'heart', size: 20 }) %> <span>This is a volunteer role. There is no salary and there are no fees. NISMCAA never asks volunteers to pay anything.</span></p>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
